WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:02.490
I hate you.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:08.370
I really hate all of you.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.960
Did you just hit me?

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.490
Julius

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.490
Do you have any idea who I am?

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:23.000
No. But regardless of who you are, 
I won't tolerate such rudeness.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:23.010
Olivia

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.000
Ugh, what a pain in the ass.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.000
This is draining all my willpower.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.760
Julius

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.760
You really don't know who I am?

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.380
Olivia

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.380
I'm sorry. I don't know much 
about the royal capital.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:39.420
She's gotta be lying about not recognizing 
the prince of her own country.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.390
What a devious protagonist.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.810
The characters were designed 
by a famous illustrator,

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.650
and famous voice actors were cast.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:52.150
It's supposedly the highly-anticipated 
new game from a major developer, but...

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.660
Julius

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.660
You're not like other girls.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:01.660
The world of this otome game is 
far too convenient for women.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:07.670
Why do I have to use my precious days off 
improving my relationship with dudes?

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.800
Traveling abroad is so fun!

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.800
Little Sister

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Traveling abroad is so fun!

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>Traveling abroad is so fun!</i>

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:20.220
She's the one who forced me to play this game.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:23.040
An otome game?

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:27.940
I want to hear the game completion audio, 
but I can't be bothered to play through it.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:30.100
But why do I have to do it?

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:34.190
You'd better, or I'll tell 
Mom about you-know-what.

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:38.350
So yeah, if you could go ahead and 
full-clear it, that would be great.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:43.330
Damn it. Why am I doing this?

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.690
I'll be holding my own tea party soon.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:47.580
Julius

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.580
I'd like you to come.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.330
Olivia

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.330
What?

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:49.870
Hold on.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:54.090
Angelica

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:54.090
She would be out of place at your tea party.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.090
What a stereotypical rich girl antagonist.

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:57.780
Why do nobles care so 
much about social status?

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:57.230
<i>I'm here at this school 
as one of its students.</i>

00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:01.370
<i>You may be my fiancée, but you have no right 
to meddle in my affairs to this degree.</i>

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:01.370
Who cares if you're a prince 
or the daughter of a duke?

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.350
And floating islands? Yeah, okay.

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.320
<i>Are you scared?</i>

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.350
<i>No, I'm fine.</i>

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:13.220
Here we go with the dungeons and monsters.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.430
This stuff tends to end up in games 
when they're developed by studios

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.860
that mainly make games for men.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:25.370
We've also got flying bikes and battleships.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:30.490
And to top it all off, we're 
fighting a war in power suits.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:38.260
Julius

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:38.260
Equipment

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:38.260
Prince uses Skill Attack!

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:38.260
Behold my ultimate attack!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.580
This game is out of control!

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:35.670
Is this really an otome game?

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:38.260
And why is it so freaking hard?!

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.090
Why are you so depressed?!

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.140
<i>I'm sorry, Olivia.</i>

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:42.430
Battle Dolphin

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.510
It'd be quicker to spend 
money on this dumb game!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:43.680
Orca Flighter

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.510
Luxion

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:47.140
Luxion

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:47.140
Stats

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:48.060
Don't underestimate 
a working adult!

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:51.090
<i>How dare you deceive 
His Highness, foul wench?</i>

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:52.650
Shut up, rich girl.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.790
<i>I wish to protect her.</i>

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.030
Shut up, trash.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:58.160
<i>Be honest. Say you love me.</i>

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.110
<i>It's only natural that I'd fall for you.</i>

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.780
Just shut up already.

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:04.060
<i>I love you, as well.</i>

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:07.160
<i>I love you the most.</i>

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.040
Are you stupid?

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.040
<i>Guys...</i>

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:13.050
What a bunch of pretentious, 
tasteless, arrogant hunks.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:16.340
The girls are excessively strong 
and have awful personalities.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.050
They're all surrounded by paramours, too.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:24.550
I... I...

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:28.250
I hate this world!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.920
It's over.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:47.580
I achieved the 100% event 
completion reverse harem ending.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:50.580
I'm so hungry.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:55.080
To the convenience store.

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.100
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:13.480
<i>I'm not dying like this!</i>

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.410
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.750
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:37.380
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:57.720
So this is how I die.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:03.380
Wh-What was that?

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:06.510
Did something happen to me?

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.820
Same old scenery, same old sky.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.520
You idiot!

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:18.720
Why did you run away?

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.020
The lady is coming today.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.740
Sorry.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.650
Unbelievable.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.650
This is why I hate country boys.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:31.710
I'm sorry.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:40.670
Balcus, tell him who the Bartfort family 
has to thank for its continued existence.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:43.970
That would be you, Zora.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.680
That's right.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.440
And you get to act like a baron

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:51.880
despite being a back country 
lord because you married me.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:55.330
Don't forget that.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:57.510
I know.

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:58.890
Of course.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.820
Why do Jenna and the others 
get to stay in the main house

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:07.190
while we're banished to the storage shed?

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.310
Why are you complaining about that now?

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.950
Lady Zora doesn't like us.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.950
Because we're not her kids?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:20.140
Yeah. Men, especially the sons of mistresses, 
can't expect to be treated any better.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.900
You should study while you can, too.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.210
Otherwise you won't be able 
to get married at the academy.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:26.420
The academy?

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:32.970
If only we were elves or beast men. 
Then we could've become someone's paramour.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.930
Paramours?

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:38.470
Wh-What kind of life is that? 
Don't men get any respect?

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:41.600
What? Of course not.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:44.230
Women hold more power in this world.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.110
<i>Women have more power?</i>

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:47.230
Angelica

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:47.230
She would be out of place at your tea party.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:51.490
<i>I recognize this world.</i>

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.620
<i>This is the world of that otome game.</i>

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:06.070
<i>And that's how I, Leon Fou Bartfort,</i>

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:09.780
<i>was reincarnated in the 
world of that otome game.</i>

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:13.720
No!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:20.100
I Hate This World

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:19.210
<i>It's been ten years since 
I regained my memories.</i>

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:24.620
<i>The Bartfort family didn't 
appear in that game.</i>

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.830
<i>In other words, I'm a background 
character, or "mob."</i>

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:33.560
<i>Naturally, I once considered using 
my game knowledge to dominate.</i>

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.620
<i>I noted down all the 
information I could recall.</i>

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:42.620
<i>Depending on how the game went, I could 
get dragged into wars or minor conflicts,</i>

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.620
<i>so I made sure to keep up 
with my training, but...</i>

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:51.540
<i>As my life on the floating island 
continued, my ambition vanished.</i>

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:59.060
<i>A mob should search for happiness as a mob.</i>

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:04.530
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:07.770
What do you mean, 
an arranged marriage meeting?!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:12.780
She's the daughter of a court 
noble I owe a great deal to.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.050
What could you possibly 
have to complain about?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.030
Seriously?

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.660
She's 50 years old and has 
been married seven times!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.040
Not only that, but all her 
husbands died in battle!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.730
She's clearly after my survivor's pension!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:27.290
It's simply an unfortunate series of events.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.860
I'm supposed to attend the academy.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.550
Normally, people find a 
marriage partner there.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:36.140
Entering the academy costs money.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:37.500
I could tolerate sending a second son,

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.550
but there's no point in sending 
a third son to the academy.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:45.150
Leon, the fact is, we don't have money.

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:48.060
There are ways to make money once 
you've entered the academy, but...

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:51.370
Attending this arranged marriage 
meeting is the right choice.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:55.070
You should be grateful someone's 
willing to marry you.

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.160
No, thank you. I refuse.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.570
Silence, lowly third son!

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:03.580
A man should work to support his family.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.830
<i>Damn this hag...</i>

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:12.180
If you refuse, I can arrange 
for you to become a soldier.

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:17.590
<i>Is she planning to have me die in battle?</i>

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:21.010
Nobody wants to marry a 
man after he's turned 20.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:26.100
How dare you complain and 
act so fussy? Know your place.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:31.080
<i>This isn't good. Unless I do 
something here, I have no future.</i>

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.110
<i>Remember.</i>

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.620
<i>I know this game and its world.</i>

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Julius

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Equipment

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Prince uses Skill Attack!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Behold my ultimate attack!

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:36.980
Orca Flighter

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:37.690
Luxion

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.110
Luxion

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.110
Stats

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.220
I just need money, right?

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.120
What?

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.630
It can't be easy being married to her, Dad.

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:57.880
Don't say that. I'm just 
grateful she married me.

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:00.260
Dad.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:03.640
I have a request.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:18.560
<i>If this really is the otome game 
I played, it should be there.</i>

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:23.730
<i>According to the calendar, the game's 
protagonist and I should be in the same grade.</i>

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:27.360
<i>If she acquires that at all, 
it'll be after she enters the academy.</i>

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.360
<i>Which means she hasn't acquired it yet.</i>

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:34.830
<i>I feel bad for doing this to her, but we'll 
be even if I can repay her eventually.</i>

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:42.680
A Carp Queen, huh? This brings back memories.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:45.410
They were a good source of 
experience for the prince and his gang

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:46.430
early in the game.

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:01.990
It should be around here somewhere.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.450
Is this...

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:06.730
Is it above me?

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:09.200
Which means...

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.960
A transporter! I was right!

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:23.170
Oh, please let me make it through.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.990
No, wait!

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.340
Ow...

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:10.510
<i>My ship's busted. Sorry, Dad.</i>

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:12.330
<i>Focus on what's next.</i>

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:20.110
<i>It's a good thing I was able to 
collect weapons and magic bullets.</i>

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:24.370
<i>It looks just like the game.</i>

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.860
<i>It's definitely in there.</i>

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:36.560
<i>Sentry robots.</i>

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.650
<i>I can handle those.</i>

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:49.460
All right. They're weak to electric 
magic bullets, just like in the game.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.680
This route is just like 
it was in the game, too.

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:58.310
I guess I really was reincarnated.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.800
<i>People die in otome games, too.</i>

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:12.950
I'll be borrowing this.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:26.590
Wow. It's so different seeing this in person.

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:29.440
An ancient spaceship.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:32.850
It's the paid item I purchased 
before I was reincarnated.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:32.140
Orca Flighter

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:32.850
Luxion

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.220
Luxion

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.220
Stats

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:49.800
This is sci-fi as hell.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:52.820
The inside of the ship 
didn't appear in the game.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.830
This must be the control room.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.330
Here we go.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:16.100
Intruder detected. Eliminate. Eliminate.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.360
<i>It didn't work? Instead of wasting 
my time fighting, I should...</i>

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:24.610
Look. I belong here.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:31.110
Your physical attributes do not 
match the registered individuals.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:34.820
You are an intruder. You will be eliminated.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.480
Damn it. It didn't work.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:40.120
Thanks for the honest response.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.620
But in that case...

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:42.870
Take this!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:48.340
What do you think of that? That's a 
stronger shock than a magic bullet.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.380
Surely that worked—huh?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:55.450
The intruder's attacks have 
reached dangerous levels.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.890
Activating magic barrier.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:58.970
What?

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.390
Hey, this isn't fair!

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:08.820
Thank you. I have learned that 
"unfair" is a compliment in battle.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.650
That wasn't a compliment, chatterbox!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.450
It has been a while since 
I last had a conversation.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.660
Perhaps I am excited.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.910
Then it's time to say goodbye.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.540
Are you using another magic grenade?

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.660
In my current state, 
those are ineffective against—

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:27.420
Idiot. That was a regular bomb.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:34.430
I am surprised. Your kind 
is obsessed with magic.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:37.550
I did not think you would 
use this type of weapon.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:42.680
I must inquire, what year 
of the new calendar is it?

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.660
The new calendar? No idea.

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:47.120
But according to the Holfort calendar—

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.000
That answers my question.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.850
I see we lost after all.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:56.790
What are you talking about?

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.450
A new breed of human.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.440
It means our old civilization was 
destroyed when faced with

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:06.460
new humans who possessed 
a power known as magic.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:10.120
But our mission has not ended.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:14.250
Eliminating new humans like 
yourself is our top priority.

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:17.740
This really is that otome game.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:21.220
Its setting makes no sense at all.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:27.230
After eliminating you, I shall 
begin my attack on the new humans.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:31.230
You can't be serious. I'm not letting you—

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:36.740
Eliminate, eliminate, eliminate...

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:41.740
<i>Just let me live a tranquil 
life like an ordinary mob.</i>

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:44.030
This world...

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:48.250
is infuriating as hell.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:52.500
What do you think you're doing? 
That won't work against—

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.260
Die, you hunk of junk!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.520
You were trying to use me, weren't you?

00:18:21.590 --> 00:18:25.040
I cannot allow myself to 
be stolen by new humans.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:30.800
Shut up. I just came to 
collect the item I paid for.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.640
Is this it?

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:43.070
Acknowledged. Acknowledged. 
Permission to activate ship granted.

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:44.310
All right.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:48.130
I have discovered some interesting 
information from the scan.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:53.520
Despite being a new human, 
you also possess old human traits.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.320
Oh, yeah?

00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:00.680
It is impossible. It is strange. 
It is terribly interesting.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:07.160
This is that otome game's setting. There's 
nothing strange or interesting about it.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:10.980
Either way, you're mine now.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:13.330
What name shall I call myself?

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:17.420
I think it was "Luxion" in the game.

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:20.710
Luxion. Name has been registered, Master.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:31.840
Did you know this world exists inside 
that insane otome game's setting?

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:33.350
Otome game?

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:36.860
Not only that, but the game balance is awful.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.730
Julius

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.730
Equipment

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.730
Prince uses Skill Attack!

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:37.860
Orca Flighter

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.360
That piece of shit expects 
you to pay real money.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.030
That sounds like nothing but nonsense to me.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:48.200
I'm sure it does. I'm pretty sure 
your existence proves it, though.

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:58.980
<i>Again? Just like last time,
I failed to die a proper death.</i>

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:03.940
<i>Come to think of it, I wonder 
what my idiot sister is doing.</i>

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:08.930
<i>I hope I'm reborn in a 
better world next time.</i>

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:13.760
The master's life is in danger.

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:16.230
He shall be transported 
to sick bay immediately.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.400
He really is an idiot.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.950
Not only did he ruin his marriage offer,

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.420
he ran off on an adventure 
and got himself killed.

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:31.410
We don't know yet that Leon is dead.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.420
You haven't heard from him in three months.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.270
I'd be more surprised if he were still alive.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:39.670
Or did he perhaps run away?

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.940
N-No...

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.290
It couldn't be!

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:01.400
Hey, guys!

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:07.450
Th-That damn brat.

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.390
This is your home, Master?

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:15.830
Yeah. It's a humble little floating 
island, but that ends today.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.840
We looted plenty of treasure on the way home.

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:29.100
<i>Having acquired a large amount of wealth, 
I declined Zora's marriage offer,</i>

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:33.740
<i>and began attending the academy 
as I had originally planned...</i>

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:51.570
<i>But the world of that otome game was 
a little bit tough for a mob like me.</i>

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:27.370
Despite how awful the world 
of that otome game is,

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:28.760
I managed to have a wonderful encounter!

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:31.110
I met the perfect gentleman 
that is my tea instructor!

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:34.260
I thought you were looking 
for a woman to marry.

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:35.840
Of course I'll look for her, too.

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.140
Next time, "Hey, Girl. Wanna Get Some Tea?"

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:39.730
What a frivolous thing to say.
